  "description": "One premium gravel bike for any occasion.\nFrom forest tracks, to rough gravel, to the unpredictable mix of Routt County Road 45, this is the bike built to handle it all. The Routt 45 pairs a longer top tube with a shorter stem and relaxed geometry, delivering a more upright posture for greater comfort, stability, and precision when the surface gets demanding.\nClearance for up to 50c-wide tires, three bottle mounts, and discreet fender eyelets give it range and versatility. It adapts to the way you ride, long days on back roads, mixed surfaces, and trails where maps end, but you don't.\nBalanced, tough, and endlessly capable, the Routt 45 is the do-everything titanium gravel bike, crafted for MOOTS riders who want one machine that never asks them to choose from a stable.",
